<Layout
	title="About Me"
	description="A little about me and my journey"
	pubDate={new Date('October 28 2025')}
	heroImage={AboutHeroImage}
	locale="en"
>
	<p>
		Welcome to my little tech corner! I am a software engineer passionate about
		building scalable, high-performance solutions. I currently work as a
		<strong>Senior Software Engineer at <a href="https://pomelo.la/pt" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Pomelo</a></strong>,
		where I dive deep into distributed architectures, real-time data processing,
		and financial systems that move millions of transactions. My journey has also
		taken me through Mercado Livre, where I learned to work with large volumes of
		data and multi-cloud architecture.
	</p>

	<p>
		Here you will find content about <strong>Development and Software</strong> —
		from Golang and Java to Python and TypeScript. I also share insights about
		<strong>Hardware and Gadgets</strong> I use every day, along with the latest
		<strong>News and Trends</strong> from the tech world. As someone who works with
		sensitive data, I also write about <strong>Digital Security and Privacy</strong>
		— increasingly important topics in our time.
	</p>

	<p>
		I love talking about <strong>Tech Careers and Culture</strong>, especially how
		to build strong teams through dojos, talks, and technical writing. I believe
		that shared knowledge multiplies knowledge!
	</p>

	<p>
		I am always learning and experimenting with new technologies. If you are a
		developer, a hardware enthusiast, or simply curious about the tech world, you
		are in the right place!
	</p>
</Layout>
